{"about_the_game":"Mini Continental Saga is a multifaceted and mixed-up game.<br>The game is a biotope simulation, a micro-history game, a card game,<br>and a tower defense game!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514950/extras/b38941e33c78405dd0910448d0c404b6.avif?t=1703734176\" width=620 height=310 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514950/extras/fe242361c8a994ce7047a231614a2a65.avif?t=1703734176\" width=620 height=96 /></span><br>The idea for this game was born as a biotope simulation game.<br>However, it is not interesting for ordinary humans to weave a history of the past!<br>In this world, not only humans,<br>but also slimes, elves, yeti, fishmen, and penguins have intelligence!<br>Even the civilization they create will not be interesting if it is ordinary!<br>You could have unicorns pulling chariots instead of horses,<br>or necromancers and mystics could have real power!<br>Observe a world filled with such a variety of creatures and supernatural power!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514950/extras/000e9d7fd50aad1b4323cbc38d898115.avif?t=1703734176\" width=620 height=220 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514950/extras/3530f8017459d7a9462e868fcc2014fe.avif?t=1703734176\" width=620 height=96 /></span><br>But you may not empathize with the nameless little people who walk the ground.<br>To avoid that, this game highlights the little people in history<br>who have the potential to move the times!<br>They have names, personalities, and intentions, and they live hard in various jobs!<br>Guided by a twist of fate (and you), they may live bizarre lives.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514950/extras/6fe0ff7e183cacdd75a110648c0667be.poster.avif?t=1703734176\" width=620 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514950/extras/6fe0ff7e183cacdd75a110648c0667be.webm?t=1703734176\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514950/extras/6fe0ff7e183cacdd75a110648c0667be.mp4?t=1703734176\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514950/extras/f5807d63059c546292d17b9b3b019a5d.avif?t=1703734176\" width=620 height=96 /></span><br>It's hard to understand what I can do in a simulation game... You don't have to worry about that!<br>In this game, all you have to do is choose a card, choose a place or person to use it!<br>Every choice you make is represented as a card,<br>each has its own unique effect and adds the power to the world!<br>But that doesn't mean you can only do simple things.<br>For example, you can encourage people to change jobs, heal wounds with magic power,<br>or take them away in a UFO and implant something in them.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514950/extras/3bb6c61e3dfd180d6e51159e1c730bfa.poster.avif?t=1703734176\" width=310 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514950/extras/3bb6c61e3dfd180d6e51159e1c730bfa.webm?t=1703734176\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514950/extras/3bb6c61e3dfd180d6e51159e1c730bfa.mp4?t=1703734176\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514950/extras/915cd0a36c6e01ae54f2ce42db021d64.avif?t=1703734176\" width=620 height=96 /></span><br>The supernatural powers featured in numerous stories can be divided into three different types in this game.<br>Holy Power, which represents the will of nature, spirits, or heavenly forces!<br>Magic Power, which represents the terrifying demonic world, or the magical power that controls all things!<br>Cosm Power, representing contact from the outer universe or the unknown extraordinary!<br>The three powers are powers you use to influence the world.<br>You will influence people's lives and change the way they live!<br>Stir this world with the power of your choice!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514950/extras/b84479bce82bc23e0b314c9cbe5768c9.poster.avif?t=1703734176\" width=310 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514950/extras/b84479bce82bc23e0b314c9cbe5768c9.webm?t=1703734176\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514950/extras/b84479bce82bc23e0b314c9cbe5768c9.mp4?t=1703734176\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514950/extras/e7e78553fb58b1ce9c20169387a2abe4.avif?t=1703734176\" width=620 height=96 /></span><br>But there are those who have their eyes on this world and want to conquer it.<br>They are called the &quot;Dark Army,&quot; and they destroy the obelisks in their way and eat this world whole!<br>To protect this world (or for &quot;your purpose&quot;?),<br>fight the Army of Darkness with the little people who live there!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514950/extras/48e4d3a60154b8da9156d042a0b6c7b7.poster.avif?t=1703734176\" width=620 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514950/extras/48e4d3a60154b8da9156d042a0b6c7b7.webm?t=1703734176\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514950/extras/48e4d3a60154b8da9156d042a0b6c7b7.mp4?t=1703734176\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514950/extras/d72e502af679d43e42df4b5a71b62a05.avif?t=1703734176\" width=620 height=96 /></span><br>This game was designed to be easy to play and is one play to several dozen minutes long.<br>Over 60 missions stand in a row! (More to be added with updates)<br>Other game modes include the Reincarnation system that allows you to bring your friends and historical figures into this world,<br>the Observation Room where you can observe the species, civilizations, equipment, and beasts of prey you discover,<br>and Free Play where you can build your own world with no time limit.<br>Enjoy this world even more with a variety of game modes!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514950/extras/dd7ab5ddfddf6d6ea080c8f03f7fe059.poster.avif?t=1703734176\" width=620 height=349 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514950/extras/dd7ab5ddfddf6d6ea080c8f03f7fe059.webm?t=1703734176\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Streaming</h2>The game permits monetization through partner programs on video and/or live streaming platforms, such as YouTube.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Wel